{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2023-01", "window": 3, "start_date": 1673827200, "end_date": 1674518399, "month_true_total": 120, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:52:57 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "131347801", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047016247", "personaname": "scones", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/youforgotthepickles/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 511, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 335, "last_played": 1677977191, "avatar": "1b798cbffdaf04785cff7d17063498fe24678039"}, "language": "english", "review": "“An enemy that walks on buildings is annoying!”", "timestamp_created": 1674403664, "timestamp_updated": 1674403664, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131324033", "author": {"steamid": "76561199033075599", "personaname": "Sub-Nominal", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199033075599/", "num_games_owned": 39, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 5060, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3014, "last_played": 1769688620, "avatar": "af25f3f7c81c1a57d2f5f2ae34774e08f1c7db62"}, "language": "english", "review": "EDF 5 is a japanese recreation of me finding a cockroach in my kitchen. EDF is a \"complex\" game. On the surface it seems simple however after the first few missions we are no longer just fighting ants or just using the Ranger class. Now we fight grabby ants, average Australian spiders and wasps, and use different classes with different weapons and capabilities. EDF has over 100 MISSIONS, so you'd better be ready to endure the onslaught of spider webs and grabby ants. EDF has a decent story, this ain't some Metal Gear level lore but it's better than nothing. The story is told almost exclusively through in-mission dialogue, not cutscenes, this means that it is possible to miss major parts of the story if you are completely surrounded by bugs and firing literally everything to kill them. Your EDF allies are some of the worst comedians ever but by god do they make a desperate fight against 1000 spiders seem like the best thing that has happened this week. Their dialogue is bland and generic but so bland and generic that it's kind of funny. Your team could be charging into their deaths against a horde of robots but as long as you all scream EDF! EDF! at the top of your lungs these aliens have zero chance of winning.\n\nNow sing it with me 4.1 players: To save our mother Earth from any alien attack, from vicious giant insects who have once again come back, we'll unleash all our forces we won't cut them any slack, THE EDF DEPLOYS!", "timestamp_created": 1674377367, "timestamp_updated": 1674377367, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131306440", "author": {"steamid": "76561198122669149", "personaname": "Temple", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198122669149/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 7877, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2293, "last_played": 1699347879, "avatar": "5eb7ca17c8e456c0d2efd98b014bbfdddfa6761f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Only 2 of my friends own this game and this makes me *unidentifiable noise* def pick it up on sale OR if you have WAY TO MUCH disposable income just get it? But you should totally get it 